            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "课程名称（含档次）高等数学A（二）（本部期末） 课程编号0701000219",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.082,
                0.236,
                0.883,
                0.253
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "专业电气、交运、电子信息等层次（本、专）本考试方式（开、闭卷）闭卷",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.275,
                0.458,
                0.293
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "一、单选题(共5题，每题4分，共20分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.308,
                0.745,
                0.368
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1.设向量 \\(\\vec{a},\\vec{b}\\) 满足 \\(|\\vec{a} -\\vec{b}| = |\\vec{a} +\\vec{b} |\\) ，则必有（）.A. \\(\\vec{a} -\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}\\) B. \\(\\vec{a} +\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}\\) C. \\(\\vec{a}\\cdot \\vec{b} = 0\\) D. \\(\\vec{a}\\times \\vec{b} = \\vec{0}\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.386,
                0.706,
                0.429
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2.二元函数 \\( f(x,y)=2x-4y-x^{2}-2y^{2} \\) 的驻点是（）.\nA. \\( (-1,-1) \\)  B. \\( (1,-1) \\)  C. \\( (-1,1) \\)  D.(1,1)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.442,
                0.729,
                0.486
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3.函数 \\(z = 3^{xy}\\) ，则在点(1,1)处的全微分 \\(dz = (\\quad)\\) A. \\(dx\\) B. \\(dy\\) C. \\(3(dx + dy)\\ln 3\\) D. \\(dx + dy\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.499,
                0.719,
                0.608
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4.设C是按逆时针方向绕行的圆周曲线 \\( x^{2}+y^{2}=R^{2} \\) ，则 \\( \\oint_{C}xy^{2}dy-x^{2}ydx=(\\quad) \\) .\nA. \\( \\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}r^{3}dr \\)  B. \\( \\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}r^{2}dr \\) \nC. \\( -\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}4r^{3}\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta dr \\)  D. \\( \\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}R^{2}dr \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.617,
                0.736,
                0.69
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5.下列正项级数中，收敛的是（）.\nA. \\( \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{5^{n}-3^{n}}{4^{n}} \\)  B. \\( \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{2^{n}} \\)  C. \\( \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}} \\)  D. \\( \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n+1}{n^{2}} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.706,
                0.458,
                0.725
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题(共5题，每题4分，共20分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.736,
                0.394,
                0.781
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "6.极限 \\( \\lim_{\\substack{x\\to0\\\\ y\\to0}}\\frac{x^{2}y^{2}}{x^{2}+2y^{2}+1}= \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
