    [
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.109,
                0.614,
                0.149
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "7. 改变二次积分的积分次序， \\( \\int_{-1}^{1} dx \\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-x^{2}}} f(x,y)dy= \\)  ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.167,
                0.655,
                0.184
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "8.椭球面  \\( 2x^{2} + 3y^{2} + z^{2} = 9 \\)  在点  \\( (1, -1, 2) \\)  处的切平面方程为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.201,
                0.655,
                0.243
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "9. 设 L 为椭圆  \\( \\frac{x^{2}}{4} + \\frac{y^{2}}{3} = 1 \\) ，其周长记为 a，则  \\( \\oint_{L} (3x^{2} + 4y^{2}) ds = \\) ____ .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.263,
                0.429,
                0.279
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "10.函数 \\( e^{x} \\) 展开成麦克劳林级数为____。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.296,
                0.468,
                0.314
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、计算题(共5题，每题10分，共50分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.324,
                0.567,
                0.354
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "11. 求通过点  \\( (1,2,-1) \\)  且与直线  \\( \\left\\{\\begin{aligned} x-2y+z=2 \\\\ 3x+y-z=1 \\end{aligned}\\right. \\)  平行的直线方程.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.081,
                0.425,
                0.324,
                0.459
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "12.已知 \\(z = e^{xy} + yx^2\\) ，求 \\(\\frac{\\partial^2z}{\\partial x\\partial y}\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.525,
                0.806,
                0.565
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "13. 计算二重积分  \\( \\iint_{D}\\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}d\\sigma \\) ，其中 D 是圆环形闭区域  \\( \\{(x,y)|a^{2}\\leq x^{2}+y^{2}\\leq b^{2}\\}(0<a<b) \\) .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.081,
                0.628,
                0.686,
                0.667
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "14. 计算 \\(\\iint_{\\Sigma} x^{3} dy dz + y^{3} dz dx + z^{3} dx dy\\)，其中 \\(\\Sigma\\) 为球面 \\(x^{2} + y^{2} + z^{2} = a^{2}\\) 的外侧.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.739,
                0.432,
                0.784
